{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/hero.png?t=1747271763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sheep Quest</i> is a high-difficulty 2D platformer where you, a sheep of questionable qualifications and more courage than sense, are chosen by providence for a special quest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap across traps clearly designed by sadists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles that probably made sense to someone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face up against six bosses, each eager to remind you that wool is not armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 handcrafted levels await you, each more determined than the last to send you plummeting into the void.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab fate by the horns and discover the secrets of the universe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master new abilities as you progress\u2014 double jump, ground slam, attack, dodge \u2014 transforming from a helpless lamb into a force capable of shaking the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey from the pastoral to the cosmic:<br>Launch to the moon, duel mechanical werewolves, brave alternate dimensions, and ascend to battle ancient gods beyond space and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you withstand the onslaught, seize your golden destiny, and bring the universe to its absurd conclusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/extras/werewolfmecha01.gif?t=1747271763\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375070?t=1747271763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375070?t=1747271763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375070/4